SUMMARY:West Art Open Mics
DESCRIPTION:Looking to get some experience playing your music in front of a
  supportive\, listening audience? Are you interested in meeting other loca
 l musicians and listening to their hand-crafted songs? If so\, come out to
  West Art's open mic nights! 1st and 3rd Wednesday from 7:00 pm to 9:00 pm
  - Acoustic Open Mic with local songwriter Andrew Pauls. This open mic wil
 l take place in the Art Bar and is focused on acoustic music (i.e.\, no dr
 um kit or amps). West Art will provide up to three inputs for your instrum
 ent and voice. Original songs are encouraged\, but cover songs are always 
 welcome! Each performer will have enough time to play 2-3 songs (10-15 min
 utes). Sign-ups at 6:30 pm! 2nd and 4th Wednesday from 7:00 - 9:00 pm - BL
 AST OFF Open Mic with Emily Siegrist. (18+ Recommended) Emily Siegrist has
  been hosting open mics known as BLAST OFF in different locations in Lanca
 ster City since 2013\, aiming to build confidence and motivation for local
  musicians\, rappers\, poets\, and comedians to reach their goals in the p
 erforming arts. This open mic is located in the Art Bar and takes place ev
 ery 2nd and 4th Wednesday. Doors and signups are at 7 pm! This event is re
 commended for ages 18+ due to possible adult themes. If you come to play\,
  come to listen! Be prepared to be an attentive audience member and suppor
 t the other performers.\n\nPrice: Not supplied by this source\; check even
 t details\n\nSchedule listed: Dec 09\, 2026 · 07:00 PM EST – 09:00 PM E
